1
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:42,820
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,590 --> 00:01:45,930
[Episode 3]

3
00:01:46,070 --> 00:01:46,420
[Danyue Pavilion]

4
00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:50,350
[Nineteen years ago]

5
00:01:50,509 --> 00:01:51,350
Jin Chunqing!

6
00:01:52,509 --> 00:01:53,840
How dare you put poison?

7
00:01:55,870 --> 00:01:57,070
Poison?

8
00:01:58,590 --> 00:01:59,479
I don't know.

9
00:01:59,479 --> 00:02:01,150
You're already on your deathbed,

10
00:02:01,150 --> 00:02:02,950
yet you still refuse to admit it.

11
00:02:25,150 --> 00:02:26,120
My Lady.

12
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,280
Several servants just came in.

13
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,630
Without saying a word,

14
00:02:29,660 --> 00:02:30,630
they took our luggage away.

15
00:02:30,630 --> 00:02:31,840
They said Second Madam ordered them

16
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,150
to move us to another courtyard.

17
00:02:33,150 --> 00:02:34,560
Those who know understand we're moving,

18
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,800
but those who don't might think

19
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:37,130
we're being kicked out.

20
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:39,180
Moving to another courtyard?

21
00:02:39,430 --> 00:02:41,400
We were doing fine in this courtyard.

22
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:42,600
Why do we have to move?

23
00:02:43,079 --> 00:02:43,740
Step aside.

24
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,480
No matter how good this place is,

25
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:48,030
it's for guests.

26
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:50,870
Since you've been recorded
in the genealogy,

27
00:02:50,870 --> 00:02:54,120
we have to arrange a new place for you.

28
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:56,160
Otherwise, if word gets out,

29
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:59,430
people will think Second Madam

30
00:02:59,750 --> 00:03:01,950
mistreats you as head of the household.

31
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:06,120
The Yunshui satin fabric

32
00:03:06,750 --> 00:03:08,350
is so black that it's creepy.

33
00:03:09,030 --> 00:03:10,190
Those who don't know

34
00:03:10,750 --> 00:03:12,680
might think you're in mourning.

35
00:03:13,190 --> 00:03:15,190
Fourth Lady, you're precious now.

36
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:18,000
How can you be tainted with bad luck?

37
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:19,750
It's better

38
00:03:21,030 --> 00:03:21,960
to throw it away.

39
00:03:26,430 --> 00:03:28,710
No wonder you were chosen by Old Madam.

40
00:03:29,470 --> 00:03:30,470
You're obedient

41
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,060
and well-behaved.

42
00:03:37,470 --> 00:03:38,430
Fourth Lady,

43
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:41,310
the stage has been set up.

44
00:03:42,470 --> 00:03:44,200
You'd better act with caution.

45
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,079
In the ancestral hall,

46
00:03:46,079 --> 00:03:48,750
I add oil to the eternal lamps every day.

47
00:03:49,630 --> 00:03:51,120
I know it best

48
00:03:53,630 --> 00:03:56,150
that a wick burning too strongly

49
00:03:57,710 --> 00:04:00,310
often won't last until dawn.

50
00:04:01,190 --> 00:04:03,870
Don't end up like your dead mother.

51
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:05,710
You...

52
00:04:05,710 --> 00:04:07,640
This cloak is Lord Yan's favorite.

53
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:10,030
He lent it to me by chance.

54
00:04:10,630 --> 00:04:11,750
If he know

55
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,900
it was ruined by you like this,

56
00:04:14,190 --> 00:04:16,390
I wonder if your lifespan is long enough

57
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,800
for you to survive

58
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,950
Lord Yan's fury.

59
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,800
Lord Yan?

60
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,600
Then you must keep it safe.

61
00:04:28,430 --> 00:04:29,760
But don't worry, Nanny.

62
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,600
My mother once taught me

63
00:04:32,270 --> 00:04:33,950
to live and let live.

64
00:04:34,310 --> 00:04:36,000
I'll clean this cloak.

65
00:04:36,510 --> 00:04:38,480
Please lead the way, Nanny.

66
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,180
Okay, Fourth Lady.

67
00:04:41,270 --> 00:04:42,270
This way, please.

68
00:04:42,270 --> 00:04:42,930
Step aside.

69
00:04:44,310 --> 00:04:44,950
This way.

70
00:04:49,790 --> 00:04:52,190
[Hanxiang Parlor]

71
00:04:53,190 --> 00:04:53,750
Mother.

72
00:05:03,190 --> 00:05:03,800
Mother,

73
00:05:04,430 --> 00:05:06,630
why are you so distracted today?

74
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:09,740
Is it because of newly arrived Qingyuan?

75
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,680
About her,

76
00:05:14,630 --> 00:05:16,030
you should listen little

77
00:05:16,430 --> 00:05:17,630
and ask little.

78
00:05:18,070 --> 00:05:20,720
Especially in front of the two Madams,

79
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:23,600
you must be very discreet

80
00:05:23,950 --> 00:05:25,510
and avoid making trouble.

81
00:05:25,950 --> 00:05:27,800
I've been warning you for years.

82
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:30,360
You must keep it in mind.

83
00:05:33,190 --> 00:05:35,070
But Qingyuan

84
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:37,130
seems gentle and quiet.

85
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,680
She should be as easy to get along with

86
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,830
as Fourth Madam was.

87
00:05:41,390 --> 00:05:42,720
Even when Second Madam moved her

88
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:45,070
to that dilapidated Danyue Pavilion,

89
00:05:45,190 --> 00:05:46,430
she didn't get angry.

90
00:05:48,159 --> 00:05:49,560
Danyue Pavilion.

91
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:57,800
Mother?

92
00:05:58,750 --> 00:05:59,240
Mother?

93
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,830
Are you all right?

94
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:07,650
Are you worried that something

95
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,850
might go wrong in Danyue Pavilion?

96
00:06:18,270 --> 00:06:19,240
My Lady!

97
00:06:19,950 --> 00:06:21,550
My Lady! Something is wrong!

98
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:22,870
Somebody, help!

99
00:06:23,510 --> 00:06:25,160
Wake up, My Lady!

100
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,680
What happened?

101
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,750
What's wrong with you, My Lady?

102
00:06:29,750 --> 00:06:31,600
Come back to us, My Lady!

103
00:06:31,830 --> 00:06:33,430
-My Lady!
-Stay away from me!

104
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:34,480
My Lady.

105
00:06:35,070 --> 00:06:35,930
Why is your face

106
00:06:36,159 --> 00:06:38,270
so pale and bloodless?

107
00:06:38,270 --> 00:06:39,240
Bloodless?

108
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:41,060
You're talking nonsense.

109
00:06:41,190 --> 00:06:43,320
She doesn't seem to be Fourth Lady now.

110
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:44,800
Jin Chunqing.

111
00:06:45,630 --> 00:06:47,230
You contemptible creature.

112
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:49,510
Murderers should pay with their lives.

113
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:50,560
Why are you here putting on a show

114
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,960
of madness and specters?

115
00:06:52,510 --> 00:06:54,120
You fool.

116
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,430
Who killed your mother?

117
00:06:56,830 --> 00:06:58,159
Who is your enemy?

118
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,970
Haven't you figured it out yet?

119
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:01,750
Then tell me,

120
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,070
who exactly is it?

121
00:07:03,310 --> 00:07:04,770
Tell me, who exactly is it?

122
00:07:04,830 --> 00:07:05,240
Right.

123
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,040
Tell us,

124
00:07:06,310 --> 00:07:07,440
who is the murderer?

125
00:07:10,390 --> 00:07:11,750
Isn't this murderer

126
00:07:14,070 --> 00:07:15,870
right here in the Xie Residence?

127
00:07:17,750 --> 00:07:19,150
What exactly do you want?

128
00:07:21,870 --> 00:07:23,070
What do I want?

129
00:07:23,770 --> 00:07:24,360
Don't kill me.

130
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,160
Don't kill me.

131
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:26,720
Of course I'm here

132
00:07:28,190 --> 00:07:29,560
to seek revenge.

133
00:07:41,090 --> 00:07:44,230
[The Wondrous Being of the Great Void]

134
00:07:44,750 --> 00:07:45,800
Slay all evil.

135
00:07:46,159 --> 00:07:47,240
Subdue all beasts.

136
00:07:47,950 --> 00:07:49,810
By the order of Celestial Master,

137
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,380
divine soldiers, be quick

138
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,610
to obey the command.

139
00:08:01,430 --> 00:08:03,870
Fourth Lady broke the evil miasma
with a blood blade.

140
00:08:03,870 --> 00:08:05,040
Please take a look, everyone.

141
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:07,970
This crack runs
right through the Jiuquan acupoint.

142
00:08:08,030 --> 00:08:09,630
The evil aura has dispersed.

143
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:14,710
Although the evil aura
in Danyue Pavilion has dispersed,

144
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,120
Jin Chunqing

145
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:18,880
seemed to have suffered a great grievance,

146
00:08:19,070 --> 00:08:21,000
resulting in immense resentment.

147
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,700
Even though she vanished,

148
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:24,200
the remaining evil aura

149
00:08:24,510 --> 00:08:26,910
will still affect the Xie family's fortune

150
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,240
to some extent.

151
00:08:31,830 --> 00:08:32,909
Then...

152
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:35,120
Then what should we do?

153
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:36,809
Don't worry, Old Madam.

154
00:08:37,510 --> 00:08:39,080
You just need to restore Danyue Pavilion

155
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:41,740
to its original state
when Jin Chunqing was here

156
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,780
and purify it with talismans.

157
00:08:44,150 --> 00:08:46,600
And with the power of this mascot
to block the evil,

158
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,400
it'll surely keep the Xie family

159
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,870
safe and sound.

160
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,360
Good.

161
00:08:52,150 --> 00:08:52,840
Good.

162
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,780
What about my granddaughter?

163
00:08:57,750 --> 00:08:59,910
Fourth Lady was possessed
by the vengeful spirit

164
00:08:59,910 --> 00:09:01,360
and lost some vital energy.

165
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,000
I'll melt a talisman in water later.

166
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,860
She'll be fine after drinking it.

167
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,900
Thank you, Celestial Master.

168
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,860
Thank you, Celestial Master.

169
00:09:16,150 --> 00:09:18,080
Stop asking for trouble here.

170
00:09:18,750 --> 00:09:19,750
Don't think I don't know

171
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:21,960
what your intentions were last night.

172
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:24,540
Who are you talking about?

173
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,120
Are you talking about me?

174
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,240
Old Madam,

175
00:09:27,670 --> 00:09:29,600
you have really misunderstood me.

176
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,600
We brought this girl back

177
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:33,270
specifically to exorcise evil spirits.

178
00:09:33,270 --> 00:09:35,080
If I hadn't arrange for her
to stay in Danyue Pavilion,

179
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,540
where else could she stay?

180
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,750
Besides,

181
00:09:38,390 --> 00:09:41,520
to suppress a ghost,
one has to stand right in front of it.

182
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:42,390
Enough.

183
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:45,500
I don't want to argue with you about this.

184
00:09:45,790 --> 00:09:46,440
Right now,

185
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:49,300
the evil spirit has been eradicated.

186
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:51,030
You all have heard

187
00:09:51,390 --> 00:09:53,250
what Celestial Master just said.

188
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,030
Qingyuan

189
00:09:55,870 --> 00:09:58,510
must stay in the Xie Residence
to ward off evil spirits.

190
00:09:58,510 --> 00:10:01,550
From now on,
whoever harbors evil intentions

191
00:10:01,870 --> 00:10:04,530
and damages
the Xie family's fortune even a bit,

192
00:10:05,390 --> 00:10:07,000
I won't spare them.

193
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:11,870
Yes.

194
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:16,720
My Lady.

195
00:10:34,150 --> 00:10:34,950
Grandmother.

196
00:10:35,150 --> 00:10:37,030
I was in a daze last night.

197
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,660
Did I do something wrong again

198
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:42,810
and harm the Xie family?

199
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:46,710
It's nothing.

200
00:10:47,270 --> 00:10:48,600
It's all in the past.

201
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:52,240
As for the restoration of Danyue Pavilion,

202
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,900
go and handle it immediately.

203
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:54,510
Yes.

204
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:56,120
You may all leave.

205
00:10:57,610 --> 00:11:00,810
[The Wondrous Being of the Great Void]

206
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,030
Do you want

207
00:10:59,750 --> 00:11:02,010
a vegetarian cake to fill you up a little?

208
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:02,670
Here.

209
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,840
Thank you, Grandmother.

210
00:11:08,110 --> 00:11:10,120
Old Madam, you're well-versed in Buddhism,

211
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,000
but Taoism

212
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,810
is somewhat different.

213
00:11:13,270 --> 00:11:13,840
Dao,

214
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,600
formless and shapeless,

215
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:16,800
is born of all things,

216
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:18,240
yet not born of itself.

217
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,170
The scriptures,

218
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:20,820
carrying the words of Dao,

219
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:22,080
clearly show the path of cultivation,

220
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:23,740
yet do not reveal themselves.

221
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:25,840
Old Madam,

222
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:29,750
there is a side hall in the back
where longevity tablets are served.

223
00:11:29,750 --> 00:11:31,210
Would you like to go with me

224
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,870
and light a lamp?

225
00:11:35,550 --> 00:11:38,150
Thank you, Celestial Master.

226
00:12:20,270 --> 00:12:22,360
So Jin Chunqing totally deserved it.

227
00:12:22,510 --> 00:12:24,550
She even tried to harm her own daughter.

228
00:12:24,550 --> 00:12:26,150
She shot herself in the foot.

229
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:28,030
In the end, she was slashed

230
00:12:28,030 --> 00:12:30,320
into oblivion by Xie Qingyuan.

231
00:12:32,870 --> 00:12:34,870
What poetic justice.

232
00:12:34,870 --> 00:12:36,270
You're right, My Lady.

233
00:12:36,270 --> 00:12:37,130
I think so, too.

234
00:12:38,150 --> 00:12:41,120
Qingyuan made such a scene last night.

235
00:12:41,870 --> 00:12:43,670
It was a pretty convincing act.

236
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:44,790
What act?

237
00:12:47,550 --> 00:12:48,360
Nothing.

238
00:12:48,510 --> 00:12:49,510
Be careful.

239
00:12:49,910 --> 00:12:51,970
Don't let the fire burn your clothes.

240
00:12:58,510 --> 00:12:59,870
What are you doing?

241
00:13:00,550 --> 00:13:02,780
Why did you throw away
someone else's wishing ribbon?

242
00:13:02,780 --> 00:13:04,740
[Li Congxin] [Xie Qingru]

243
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:08,520
Mine naturally belongs in the very center.

244
00:13:09,670 --> 00:13:11,080
No one can outshine me.

245
00:13:12,790 --> 00:13:13,790
Does it look good?

246
00:13:15,630 --> 00:13:16,510
You're

247
00:13:17,510 --> 00:13:19,630
spoiled rotten by your father.

248
00:13:19,790 --> 00:13:21,450
You always want to be the best.

249
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:22,670
In the future,

250
00:13:22,670 --> 00:13:24,130
if you marry into a family,

251
00:13:24,390 --> 00:13:26,630
you'll definitely be an intolerant madam.

252
00:13:26,630 --> 00:13:27,840
My husband

253
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:30,560
will naturally only have me by his side.

254
00:13:31,790 --> 00:13:32,910
Then, Second Lady,

255
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:35,720
have you asked the young master
of the Marquis of Danyang

256
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:36,600
if he is willing

257
00:13:36,750 --> 00:13:37,750
to only have a wife

258
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:38,900
and no concubines?

259
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,480
Mother.

260
00:13:41,270 --> 00:13:42,870
Nanny Liu is making fun of me.

261
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:45,030
I didn't say I'm going to marry Congxin.

262
00:13:45,030 --> 00:13:45,910
Right.

263
00:13:45,910 --> 00:13:47,080
You don't want to marry him.

264
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:48,000
Then why did you write his name

265
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,390
on your red ribbon?

266
00:13:49,280 --> 00:13:50,870
[Li Congxin] [Xie Qingru]

267
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:52,270
That's because

268
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:55,090
he's the person I miss the most.

269
00:13:57,510 --> 00:13:58,970
The person I miss the most?

270
00:14:27,250 --> 00:14:34,090
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

271
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:28,250
You can't hit me.

272
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:29,360
Chunqing,

273
00:14:29,750 --> 00:14:32,720
there is a new development
in the corruption case I'm handling.

274
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:34,120
I need to go check it out immediately.

275
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:41,310
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

276
00:14:34,630 --> 00:14:37,910
Could you look after Run for half a day?

277
00:14:38,270 --> 00:14:39,240
When I come back,

278
00:14:39,750 --> 00:14:40,840
I'll pick him up.

279
00:14:41,420 --> 00:14:44,940
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

280
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:42,480
Rest assured.

281
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:48,130
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

282
00:14:48,150 --> 00:14:55,290
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

283
00:14:55,310 --> 00:15:02,430
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

284
00:14:57,670 --> 00:14:58,730
Do you want to play?

285
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:00,040
Let's play together.

286
00:15:02,450 --> 00:15:10,220
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

287
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:13,540
♪ Rise and fall take turns ♪

288
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:12,120
Little Loser.

289
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:13,570
You daren't play?

290
00:15:13,570 --> 00:15:16,970
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

291
00:15:14,550 --> 00:15:15,150
Come on.

292
00:15:15,510 --> 00:15:16,040
Catch me.

293
00:15:16,990 --> 00:15:24,260
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

294
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:20,150
Don't run.

295
00:15:23,150 --> 00:15:24,750
I'll take you downstairs to play tomorrow.

296
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:31,140
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

297
00:15:24,960 --> 00:15:25,440
Sure.

298
00:15:25,550 --> 00:15:26,360
I saw there are

299
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:28,200
a lot of wild pheasants downstairs.

300
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:29,630
Those are wild ducks.

301
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:31,160
No matter if they're pheasants or ducks,

302
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:38,350
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

303
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:33,240
let's go downstairs
and catch them tomorrow.

304
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:34,200
Sure.

305
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:35,600
Let's get a net and catch a bunch.

306
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:37,030
Who's still up so late?

307
00:15:38,030 --> 00:15:39,790
You little rascal.

308
00:15:38,540 --> 00:15:42,330
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

309
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:41,360
You're so naughty.

310
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:42,960
You're a bad influence on Run.

311
00:15:42,350 --> 00:15:45,690
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

312
00:15:45,720 --> 00:15:52,530
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

313
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:48,870
Run,

314
00:15:49,270 --> 00:15:50,270
go to sleep early.

315
00:15:51,630 --> 00:15:52,360
Be a good boy.

316
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:54,480
I'll make you lots of yummy food tomorrow.

317
00:15:52,550 --> 00:16:00,490
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

318
00:15:55,270 --> 00:15:55,960
Okay.

319
00:15:56,600 --> 00:15:57,150
Good boy.

320
00:16:00,510 --> 00:16:07,510
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

321
00:16:07,530 --> 00:16:11,480
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

322
00:16:11,500 --> 00:16:14,870
♪ Lonely home boat glides slow
through dark twilight ♪

323
00:16:14,890 --> 00:16:20,250
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

324
00:16:15,550 --> 00:16:17,210
Let's go catch fish tomorrow.

325
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:19,600
I can't swim.

326
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:22,030
You can't do anything.

327
00:16:22,870 --> 00:16:23,910
Little Loser.

328
00:16:25,150 --> 00:16:25,960
Fine.

329
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:27,580
You can do many things.

330
00:16:27,670 --> 00:16:28,600
I think

331
00:16:28,870 --> 00:16:30,800
you're more like a naughty monkey.

332
00:16:31,030 --> 00:16:31,830
Little Loser.

333
00:16:32,110 --> 00:16:32,840
Little Monkey.

334
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:33,640
Little Loser.

335
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:35,240
Little Monkey.

336
00:16:37,030 --> 00:16:38,320
See? You can't catch me.

337
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:39,120
Give it to me.

338
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:39,870
No.

339
00:16:55,390 --> 00:16:56,150
Mom,

340
00:16:56,870 --> 00:16:58,470
you look so beautiful today.

341
00:16:59,630 --> 00:17:00,230
Come here,

342
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:01,670
I'll do your hair too.

343
00:17:06,790 --> 00:17:07,920
I'm

344
00:17:08,829 --> 00:17:10,630
going to see an old friend later.

345
00:17:12,270 --> 00:17:13,550
After I see her,

346
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:16,480
we'll move, okay?

347
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:17,790
Move?

348
00:17:18,510 --> 00:17:19,770
Where are we moving to?

349
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:27,810
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

350
00:17:20,750 --> 00:17:22,109
To a place

351
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:24,440
where it's always spring

352
00:17:25,550 --> 00:17:27,480
and flowers are blooming all year.

353
00:17:27,829 --> 00:17:34,470
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

354
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:31,270
As long as you're with me,

355
00:17:31,270 --> 00:17:32,430
I'll go anywhere.

356
00:17:34,500 --> 00:17:38,520
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

357
00:17:38,550 --> 00:17:42,020
♪ Lonely home boat glides slow
through dark twilight ♪

358
00:17:41,590 --> 00:17:44,110
Mom, can we take Little Loser with us?

359
00:17:42,100 --> 00:17:48,930
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

360
00:17:46,350 --> 00:17:47,400
Little Loser.

361
00:17:48,350 --> 00:17:48,960
Come down.

362
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:57,530
♪ I chant and sigh; one cup of spring,
drunk through turns of year ♪

363
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:53,000
You.

364
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:55,840
Don't give people nicknames causally.

365
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:56,400
Later,

366
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,680
you and Run go out

367
00:17:57,750 --> 00:17:59,640
and buy some of your favorite sweets.

368
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:00,550
Thank you, Mom.

369
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:04,310
Come.

370
00:18:04,400 --> 00:18:06,060
-Come catch me.
-Give it back.

371
00:18:06,790 --> 00:18:08,450
-Come catch me.
-Give it back.

372
00:18:08,510 --> 00:18:10,030
Slow down.

373
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:11,830
Give it back.

374
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:26,090
Something's wrong.

375
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:37,290
What are those people doing in your house?

376
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:39,010
Come with me, quick!

377
00:19:05,070 --> 00:19:05,680
Mother!

378
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:31,350
What was that sound?

379
00:19:31,350 --> 00:19:31,830
Chase them.

380
00:19:31,830 --> 00:19:32,400
Up there.

381
00:19:33,310 --> 00:19:33,770
Search.

382
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:39,830
Mom.

383
00:19:39,830 --> 00:19:40,790
Run!

384
00:19:41,030 --> 00:19:42,590
Mom!

385
00:19:43,270 --> 00:19:43,800
Hurry up.

386
00:19:48,110 --> 00:19:48,790
This way.

387
00:19:56,720 --> 00:19:57,640
Let me go!

388
00:19:58,240 --> 00:19:58,790
Get in!

389
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:04,820
Over there!

390
00:20:06,110 --> 00:20:06,680
Hurry up!

391
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:13,160
Mom!

392
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:22,480
Mom!

393
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:03,440
Mom.

394
00:21:04,350 --> 00:21:05,070
Mom.

395
00:21:06,030 --> 00:21:06,830
Mom.

396
00:21:09,110 --> 00:21:09,960
Mom.

397
00:21:11,070 --> 00:21:11,830
Mom.

398
00:21:12,550 --> 00:21:13,720
Mom!

399
00:21:17,160 --> 00:21:18,070
Mom!

400
00:21:19,350 --> 00:21:20,400
Mom!

401
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:21,750
Mom!

402
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:24,030
Mom!

403
00:21:25,310 --> 00:21:26,310
Let me go!

404
00:21:26,440 --> 00:21:28,310
I'm going to find my mom.

405
00:21:30,110 --> 00:21:31,590
Your mom is already dead.

406
00:21:32,310 --> 00:21:33,750
She is still alive.

407
00:21:34,070 --> 00:21:35,200
Before dawn,

408
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,880
-I went home.
-Let go!

409
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:39,030
My mom and my younger brother.

410
00:21:39,030 --> 00:21:41,030
All 73 people of our Shen family

411
00:21:41,680 --> 00:21:43,110
were killed by them.

412
00:21:55,110 --> 00:21:56,790
After you passed out last night,

413
00:21:56,790 --> 00:21:57,960
I saw it was safe,

414
00:21:58,240 --> 00:21:59,840
so I went back and took a look.

415
00:22:00,110 --> 00:22:01,170
I didn't expect...

416
00:22:01,550 --> 00:22:02,640
Why don't you cry?

417
00:22:03,720 --> 00:22:04,640
My tears

418
00:22:05,310 --> 00:22:07,040
have dried up since last night.

419
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:10,270
Without Mom,

420
00:22:10,830 --> 00:22:11,880
I have no home.

421
00:22:12,720 --> 00:22:13,720
What should we do?

422
00:22:14,750 --> 00:22:16,000
How will we survive?

423
00:22:17,510 --> 00:22:19,110
We must remember all of this.

424
00:22:19,510 --> 00:22:20,480
When we grow up,

425
00:22:20,750 --> 00:22:22,480
we must bring the truth to light

426
00:22:22,590 --> 00:22:24,640
and bring the sinners to justice.

427
00:22:25,310 --> 00:22:26,550
Every blood debt

428
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:27,510
has a name

429
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:29,370
and must be paid off.

430
00:22:31,030 --> 00:22:31,830
My mom

431
00:22:31,960 --> 00:22:33,560
was the best mom in the world.

432
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:34,740
I'll make those

433
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:36,240
who killed her

434
00:22:36,240 --> 00:22:37,750
suffer dearly for this.

435
00:22:47,400 --> 00:22:48,860
My father left this for me.

436
00:22:52,070 --> 00:22:52,880
Take it.

437
00:22:55,510 --> 00:22:56,830
When we meet again,

438
00:22:57,640 --> 00:22:59,640
we'll recognize each other by this.

439
00:23:00,440 --> 00:23:01,440
Are you leaving?

440
00:23:03,070 --> 00:23:04,790
They're looking for me all over the city.

441
00:23:04,790 --> 00:23:06,650
I can't stay in Hengtang anymore.

442
00:23:06,790 --> 00:23:09,160
I don't even know if I can survive.

443
00:23:10,830 --> 00:23:11,680
Trust me.

444
00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:12,880
One day,

445
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:15,240
I'll definitely return to Hengtang.

446
00:23:15,240 --> 00:23:17,240
We'll surely meet each other again.

447
00:23:17,720 --> 00:23:18,200
Okay.

448
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:19,400
We have a deal.

449
00:23:19,750 --> 00:23:20,920
When you return to Hengtang,

450
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:22,180
we'll meet here again.

451
00:23:31,270 --> 00:23:32,680
Later, I learned

452
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:35,400
his name is Shen Run.

453
00:23:36,790 --> 00:23:38,680
He is the one I've been missing.

454
00:23:47,350 --> 00:23:48,590
Last night,

455
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:50,730
I was haunted by an evil spirit.

456
00:23:53,270 --> 00:23:55,600
Its face was deathly pale and terrifying.

457
00:23:57,160 --> 00:23:58,590
I took a closer look

458
00:23:58,880 --> 00:24:01,140
and found it was the dead estate manager.

459
00:24:01,790 --> 00:24:03,790
He lay on my bed and refused to leave.

460
00:24:04,680 --> 00:24:06,440
He, weeping blood, asked me

461
00:24:07,400 --> 00:24:09,510
to get justice for him, otherwise...

462
00:24:11,480 --> 00:24:13,540
Otherwise, he would take me with him.

463
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:16,410
I'll definitely find out the truth

464
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:19,260
and get justice for that estate manager.

465
00:24:21,830 --> 00:24:23,480
A case

466
00:24:24,480 --> 00:24:26,790
cannot be solved overnight.

467
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:29,020
Your Lordship,

468
00:24:29,030 --> 00:24:30,240
have you thought of

469
00:24:30,880 --> 00:24:32,110
a countermeasure?

470
00:24:33,270 --> 00:24:35,530
I've already asked a master for a ritual.

471
00:24:36,070 --> 00:24:37,240
He said

472
00:24:38,030 --> 00:24:40,790
it's best to donate some merit
to the dead estate manager

473
00:24:40,790 --> 00:24:42,850
to help him attain early liberation.

474
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:45,400
This way, I'll be free of the evil spirit,

475
00:24:45,640 --> 00:24:46,640
and the Xie family

476
00:24:47,030 --> 00:24:48,630
will also naturally be safe.

477
00:24:51,030 --> 00:24:51,880
I

478
00:24:51,880 --> 00:24:54,080
will give orders to prepare banknotes.

479
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:56,750
But the amount of money

480
00:24:58,240 --> 00:24:59,590
isn't a small sum.

481
00:24:59,590 --> 00:25:00,510
Three days.

482
00:25:02,160 --> 00:25:04,070
Don't delay my ritual.

483
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:06,750
Certainly.

484
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:07,960
Alright.

485
00:25:11,960 --> 00:25:12,590
By the way,

486
00:25:13,350 --> 00:25:14,200
Old Madam Xie,

487
00:25:14,750 --> 00:25:16,550
I have a cloak made of Yunshui satin

488
00:25:16,550 --> 00:25:17,880
in Fourth Lady's hands.

489
00:25:18,240 --> 00:25:19,160
I hope

490
00:25:19,310 --> 00:25:21,110
she can also bring it along then.

491
00:25:22,270 --> 00:25:23,880
What do you mean?

492
00:25:26,110 --> 00:25:27,070
Nothing.

493
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:29,880
I just took a shine to Fourth Lady.

494
00:25:32,790 --> 00:25:34,240
Three days later at noon,

495
00:25:34,880 --> 00:25:36,340
Qingyuan will definitely

496
00:25:37,200 --> 00:25:38,680
arrive on time.

497
00:25:45,510 --> 00:25:49,830
Yan Rui has focused only
on our Xie family time and again.

498
00:25:50,350 --> 00:25:53,920
But Hengtang is vast.
Since the wind is blowing,

499
00:25:54,590 --> 00:25:57,920
the eaves bells of all families
should ring.

500
00:26:01,830 --> 00:26:03,200
Celestial Master said

501
00:26:03,550 --> 00:26:04,830
Danyue Pavilion

502
00:26:05,070 --> 00:26:08,480
must be restored exactly as it was before.

503
00:26:09,920 --> 00:26:11,650
It was really difficult for me.

504
00:26:11,830 --> 00:26:14,110
I couldn't sleep for nights,

505
00:26:14,440 --> 00:26:15,510
worrying about it.

506
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:17,270
But then I thought,

507
00:26:17,590 --> 00:26:19,850
this concerns the family's reputation.

508
00:26:20,000 --> 00:26:21,070
And Old Madam

509
00:26:20,060 --> 00:26:24,270
[Danyue Pavilion]

510
00:26:21,240 --> 00:26:23,400
gave me strict orders repeatedly.

511
00:26:23,830 --> 00:26:24,350
So

512
00:26:24,720 --> 00:26:25,960
I made up my mind.

513
00:26:26,310 --> 00:26:28,160
Even if I had to risk my life,

514
00:26:28,310 --> 00:26:29,960
I must get it done, right?

515
00:26:30,350 --> 00:26:34,030
[Danyue Pavilion]

516
00:26:30,640 --> 00:26:32,470
I've ordered someone to brew

517
00:26:32,590 --> 00:26:34,400
the black tea you love

518
00:26:34,590 --> 00:26:36,160
and keep it warm on the stove.

519
00:26:36,160 --> 00:26:38,400
I wanted you to have a warm sip

520
00:26:38,790 --> 00:26:40,350
as soon as you returned.

521
00:26:40,290 --> 00:26:42,070
[Danyue Pavilion]

522
00:26:47,480 --> 00:26:48,270
Look.

523
00:26:49,110 --> 00:26:51,590
Look at this pitiful look.

524
00:26:52,350 --> 00:26:54,720
If Baoxian weren't standing here,

525
00:26:54,920 --> 00:26:57,160
I would really think

526
00:26:57,680 --> 00:27:00,270
our Fourth Madam had returned.

527
00:27:01,880 --> 00:27:04,680
Fourth Lady can certainly feel

528
00:27:04,830 --> 00:27:06,790
the elders' care for her.

529
00:27:07,590 --> 00:27:09,390
From the ornaments in this room,

530
00:27:09,550 --> 00:27:12,750
it's evident that you and Second Madam
put a lot of effort.

531
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:13,610
It's my duty.

532
00:27:14,680 --> 00:27:16,680
But the timber

533
00:27:17,070 --> 00:27:18,750
looks like inferior fir wood

534
00:27:18,830 --> 00:27:19,880
with a layer of paint on it.

535
00:27:19,880 --> 00:27:20,790
Nonsense.

536
00:27:21,070 --> 00:27:22,070
What inferior...

537
00:27:22,270 --> 00:27:23,310
How could we

538
00:27:23,590 --> 00:27:25,200
pass off inferior wood as quality one?

539
00:27:25,200 --> 00:27:28,200
Although I don't know how favored
Fourth Madam was back then,

540
00:27:28,200 --> 00:27:29,750
I heard that the items placed in this room

541
00:27:29,750 --> 00:27:31,720
were all top-notch.

542
00:27:32,030 --> 00:27:33,720
But right now, the items in this room

543
00:27:33,720 --> 00:27:34,830
are nothing like them at all.

544
00:27:34,830 --> 00:27:35,680
How?

545
00:27:36,590 --> 00:27:37,250
Take a look.

546
00:27:37,510 --> 00:27:38,310
Baoxian.

547
00:27:40,310 --> 00:27:41,400
Fourth Lady.

548
00:27:41,550 --> 00:27:42,240
Nanny.

549
00:27:42,790 --> 00:27:45,590
Grandmother asked the second branch
to restore Danyue Pavilion.

550
00:27:45,590 --> 00:27:46,350
I know

551
00:27:46,640 --> 00:27:47,960
Second Madam is too busy usually.

552
00:27:47,960 --> 00:27:49,720
She also has to manage the household.

553
00:27:49,720 --> 00:27:50,830
These trivial matters

554
00:27:50,830 --> 00:27:52,490
are all left for you to handle.

555
00:27:52,720 --> 00:27:54,270
The accounts are complicated.

556
00:27:54,270 --> 00:27:56,590
Baoxian just kindly wanted to remind you,

557
00:27:56,590 --> 00:27:58,790
worrying you might be deceived by bad men.

558
00:27:58,790 --> 00:27:59,440
Right.

559
00:28:00,400 --> 00:28:01,070
Look.

560
00:28:01,720 --> 00:28:03,160
Our Fourth Lady

561
00:28:03,160 --> 00:28:04,400
is so reasonable.

562
00:28:05,160 --> 00:28:07,160
Get better eyes and look carefully.

563
00:28:07,350 --> 00:28:08,270
Look.

564
00:28:08,310 --> 00:28:08,910
Over here.

565
00:28:09,270 --> 00:28:10,070
And over here.

566
00:28:10,200 --> 00:28:13,110
These are all top-quality

567
00:28:13,480 --> 00:28:14,550
rosewood.

568
00:28:15,160 --> 00:28:17,030
And the ornaments in the room

569
00:28:17,030 --> 00:28:18,830
are top-notch items that can only be found

570
00:28:18,830 --> 00:28:20,590
in the capital.

571
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:22,720
This grand Danyue Pavilion

572
00:28:22,720 --> 00:28:24,750
now has the best furnishings

573
00:28:25,070 --> 00:28:26,830
in our residence.

574
00:28:27,920 --> 00:28:29,720
Don't be picky.

575
00:28:30,030 --> 00:28:31,640
I like to be picky.

576
00:28:31,960 --> 00:28:33,000
You damn servant.

577
00:28:33,030 --> 00:28:33,640
Baoxian.

578
00:28:34,310 --> 00:28:35,070
Look at her.

579
00:28:37,440 --> 00:28:38,200
Nanny Na,

580
00:28:38,400 --> 00:28:39,800
you'd better be careful.

581
00:28:40,160 --> 00:28:41,110
I heard

582
00:28:41,270 --> 00:28:44,800
that Grandmother hates people
who line their pockets the most.

583
00:28:45,880 --> 00:28:47,640
If restoring Danyue Pavilion

584
00:28:47,680 --> 00:28:49,590
causes a rift between you and others,

585
00:28:49,590 --> 00:28:51,590
then my sin would be great.

586
00:28:53,000 --> 00:28:54,880
You may not know this, Fourth Lady.

587
00:28:54,880 --> 00:28:55,960
Our residence

588
00:28:56,310 --> 00:28:58,040
has to both keep up appearances

589
00:28:58,400 --> 00:28:59,720
and save money.

590
00:28:59,720 --> 00:29:01,680
You know that Old Madam

591
00:29:01,680 --> 00:29:04,030
never liked extravagance.

592
00:29:05,160 --> 00:29:05,830
Yes.

593
00:29:06,160 --> 00:29:07,360
You're right, Nanny.

594
00:29:07,590 --> 00:29:08,550
No matter what,

595
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:10,070
thank you for your hard work.

596
00:29:10,070 --> 00:29:11,270
It's my duty.

597
00:29:11,390 --> 00:29:14,200
[Fuyu Fair]

598
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:12,930
Have a cup of tea.

599
00:29:16,750 --> 00:29:19,510
You're indeed smart, Fourth Lady.

600
00:29:20,240 --> 00:29:21,550
You and your mother

601
00:29:22,070 --> 00:29:23,400
look so alike.

602
00:29:23,790 --> 00:29:24,920
Looking at you,

603
00:29:25,440 --> 00:29:26,720
I'm in a trance.

604
00:29:37,680 --> 00:29:39,720
I heard that Lord Yan likes women

605
00:29:39,720 --> 00:29:41,000
with slender hands.

606
00:29:41,110 --> 00:29:43,400
You must take care of yours, Fourth Lady.

607
00:29:46,960 --> 00:29:47,490
Get lost.

608
00:29:53,680 --> 00:29:55,740
Are you waiting for dinner? Let's go.

609
00:29:57,790 --> 00:30:00,070
My Lady, you're amazing.

610
00:30:00,110 --> 00:30:03,380
[Danyue Pavilion]

611
00:30:01,110 --> 00:30:01,880
Let's go.

612
00:30:02,750 --> 00:30:04,070
This damn old woman.

613
00:30:04,240 --> 00:30:05,790
She's always taking credit for herself.

614
00:30:05,790 --> 00:30:08,070
She must have embezzled a lot of money.

615
00:30:08,240 --> 00:30:10,590
Why hasn't this evil person
gotten her retribution yet?

616
00:30:10,590 --> 00:30:11,680
Take it easy.

617
00:30:12,240 --> 00:30:13,440
Real evil spirits

618
00:30:13,440 --> 00:30:14,970
are all in people's hearts.

619
00:30:15,270 --> 00:30:17,830
They can never be eliminated.

620
00:30:18,200 --> 00:30:20,480
Little ones who rush to the front like her

621
00:30:20,640 --> 00:30:22,570
will be dealt with sooner or later.

622
00:30:23,440 --> 00:30:25,270
Now that you're confirmed as the mascot,

623
00:30:25,270 --> 00:30:27,270
do you have any other plans, My Lady?

624
00:30:27,790 --> 00:30:28,990
Where is Third Madam?

625
00:30:29,350 --> 00:30:30,920
It's said that she had a relapse.

626
00:30:30,920 --> 00:30:31,920
It's inconvenient for her to go out.

627
00:30:31,920 --> 00:30:33,550
She's been hiding
in Hanxiang Parlor these days,

628
00:30:33,550 --> 00:30:35,610
not daring to come out and see guests.

629
00:30:35,720 --> 00:30:37,550
But the third branch is also pitiful,

630
00:30:37,550 --> 00:30:38,950
suppressed everywhere.

631
00:30:39,160 --> 00:30:40,650
Eldest Lady lives a life even worse than

632
00:30:40,650 --> 00:30:43,080
that of a favored maid in the residence.

633
00:30:45,070 --> 00:30:46,670
Can she hide herself from it?

634
00:30:47,220 --> 00:30:49,830
[Danyue Pavilion]

635
00:30:47,510 --> 00:30:48,640
It's not that easy.

636
00:30:50,750 --> 00:30:52,160
By the way, what about the cloak?

637
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:53,030
Is it washed?

638
00:30:53,830 --> 00:30:54,630
It's cleaned.

639
00:30:54,680 --> 00:30:56,940
Shall we return it to Lord Yan's mansion?

640
00:30:58,030 --> 00:30:59,030
It's not time yet.

641
00:30:59,680 --> 00:31:01,310
You mean

642
00:31:01,750 --> 00:31:02,610
we should wait?

643
00:31:03,270 --> 00:31:04,800
But what are we waiting for?

644
00:31:04,960 --> 00:31:05,790
Fourth Lady.

645
00:31:07,930 --> 00:31:10,150
[Danyue Pavilion]

646
00:31:10,270 --> 00:31:11,000
Fourth Lady.

647
00:31:11,160 --> 00:31:12,620
Old Madam wants to see you.

648
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:16,440
The wait is over.

649
00:31:31,720 --> 00:31:32,520
Grandmother.

650
00:31:33,270 --> 00:31:34,070
How is it?

651
00:31:34,790 --> 00:31:37,000
Is the room comfortable?

652
00:31:38,480 --> 00:31:40,240
Thank you for your concern, Grandmother.

653
00:31:40,240 --> 00:31:41,510
Danyue Pavilion has been restored

654
00:31:41,510 --> 00:31:43,770
by Second Madam and Nanny Rong very well.

655
00:31:44,350 --> 00:31:45,310
That's good.

656
00:31:46,350 --> 00:31:47,350
From now on,

657
00:31:47,640 --> 00:31:49,480
this is your home.

658
00:31:49,830 --> 00:31:51,090
Feel free to live here.

659
00:31:51,350 --> 00:31:52,810
Everyone in the Xie family

660
00:31:53,270 --> 00:31:54,680
will protect you.

661
00:31:56,070 --> 00:31:56,750
Come here.

662
00:31:57,110 --> 00:31:58,790
Sit next to me.

663
00:31:59,830 --> 00:32:00,480
Yes.

664
00:32:04,270 --> 00:32:05,310
I have

665
00:32:05,880 --> 00:32:07,400
an important thing

666
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:09,110
for you to handle.

667
00:32:10,110 --> 00:32:11,480
The day before yesterday,

668
00:32:11,480 --> 00:32:13,640
I promised Lord Yan some banknotes.

669
00:32:14,070 --> 00:32:17,830
Take that Yunshui satin cloak with you

670
00:32:18,480 --> 00:32:21,310
and deliver them to him personally.

671
00:32:23,640 --> 00:32:25,480
Grandmother, you must be joking.

672
00:32:25,480 --> 00:32:26,480
In the outer courtyard,

673
00:32:26,480 --> 00:32:28,610
aren't there servants to run errands?

674
00:32:30,440 --> 00:32:33,920
No matter how many precious tribute teas
there are in the capital,

675
00:32:33,920 --> 00:32:37,350
Lord Yan still

676
00:32:37,590 --> 00:32:39,590
prefers Yunya tea.

677
00:32:40,200 --> 00:32:41,350
It's refreshing.

678
00:32:44,270 --> 00:32:46,270
Since you've joined the Xie family,

679
00:32:46,640 --> 00:32:47,960
your life and fate

680
00:32:48,400 --> 00:32:51,200
are tied to the Xie family.

681
00:32:52,110 --> 00:32:54,750
I like your cleverness.

682
00:32:55,830 --> 00:32:57,110
There are some things

683
00:32:58,200 --> 00:32:59,860
that even if I didn't tell you,

684
00:33:00,350 --> 00:33:01,830
you already knew.

685
00:33:02,350 --> 00:33:03,550
Otherwise, that day,

686
00:33:03,680 --> 00:33:04,830
on the boat,

687
00:33:05,030 --> 00:33:07,680
you wouldn't have said those things to me.

688
00:33:08,510 --> 00:33:09,200
Right?

689
00:33:13,310 --> 00:33:14,200
I understood.

690
00:33:15,350 --> 00:33:16,200
That's good.

691
00:33:33,880 --> 00:33:35,610
How come it's you, Fourth Lady?

692
00:33:36,270 --> 00:33:37,830
The Xie family is so inconsiderate.

693
00:33:37,830 --> 00:33:39,430
They asked you to come alone?

694
00:33:40,510 --> 00:33:41,440
Where is Lord Yan?

695
00:33:41,440 --> 00:33:42,480
He's waiting for you in the courtyard.

696
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:43,480
Follow me please.

697
00:33:52,240 --> 00:33:53,270
-Hurry up.
-Okay.

698
00:33:58,790 --> 00:33:59,440
Hurry up.

699
00:34:09,800 --> 00:34:11,510
His Lordship might have left
for some urgent matter.

700
00:34:11,510 --> 00:34:13,440
Wait here please. I'll go find him.

701
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:48,280
How frivolous.

702
00:34:50,440 --> 00:34:51,770
What are you looking at?

703
00:34:55,550 --> 00:34:57,630
Are you that curious about me?

704
00:34:59,360 --> 00:35:00,400
Why don't I

705
00:35:00,710 --> 00:35:02,550
show you around?

706
00:35:03,110 --> 00:35:03,970
Your Lordship.

707
00:35:04,320 --> 00:35:06,590
I'm here to deliver banknotes
for my grandmother.

708
00:35:06,590 --> 00:35:07,800
And that cloak.

709
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:09,230
I've had it cleaned.

710
00:35:09,550 --> 00:35:11,510
I'm returning it to its owner.

711
00:35:14,150 --> 00:35:15,670
Why do I remember

712
00:35:16,150 --> 00:35:17,360
there is also Yunya?

713
00:35:22,150 --> 00:35:22,960
Yunya is here.

714
00:35:25,480 --> 00:35:26,340
Your Lordship.

715
00:35:26,550 --> 00:35:27,360
The tea

716
00:35:27,550 --> 00:35:29,210
needs to be stored carefully,

717
00:35:29,480 --> 00:35:31,480
I've asked a servant to take it down.

718
00:35:31,710 --> 00:35:32,920
But

719
00:35:33,590 --> 00:35:35,710
do you really live in such a place?

720
00:35:36,070 --> 00:35:37,330
Isn't this place good?

721
00:35:37,670 --> 00:35:39,600
It has mountains, water, and wine,

722
00:35:40,510 --> 00:35:42,240
as well as a beauties to admire.

723
00:35:43,190 --> 00:35:44,000
Good.

724
00:35:44,920 --> 00:35:45,880
Very good.

725
00:35:46,320 --> 00:35:47,760
Then I hope you enjoy it.

726
00:35:48,630 --> 00:35:49,890
I'll take my leave now.

727
00:35:53,400 --> 00:35:55,510
I recently learned a new trick.

728
00:35:56,360 --> 00:35:58,160
Since you're so knowledgeable,

729
00:35:58,360 --> 00:36:00,090
why don't you take a look for me?

730
00:36:11,000 --> 00:36:13,000
Turmeric water.

731
00:36:22,280 --> 00:36:23,480
Plant ash.

732
00:36:32,230 --> 00:36:33,480
This way,

733
00:36:35,190 --> 00:36:38,960
one can conjure up a bloody

734
00:36:39,190 --> 00:36:40,670
ghost-killing show.

735
00:36:49,150 --> 00:36:50,280
Isn't it wonderful?

736
00:36:52,800 --> 00:36:53,660
Your Lordship,

737
00:36:54,110 --> 00:36:55,640
what are you talking about?

738
00:36:57,710 --> 00:36:59,630
The Xie Residence is blessed
with great fortune.

739
00:36:59,630 --> 00:37:00,760
How could those monsters and ghosts

740
00:37:00,760 --> 00:37:02,190
possibly enter?

741
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:08,920
Right.

742
00:37:09,670 --> 00:37:11,200
That's what I thought, too.

743
00:37:14,710 --> 00:37:17,550
But what if the one that entered

744
00:37:17,630 --> 00:37:19,030
is a cunning little fox?

745
00:37:27,800 --> 00:37:29,230
You're so perceptive.

746
00:37:29,550 --> 00:37:31,880
I made a fool of myself in front of you.

747
00:37:34,320 --> 00:37:35,800
Fourth Lady, you always like to play

748
00:37:35,800 --> 00:37:37,110
interesting tricks.

749
00:37:38,840 --> 00:37:40,700
Starting fires with sugar balls.

750
00:37:42,550 --> 00:37:44,550
Stabbing talismans with turmeric.

751
00:37:46,000 --> 00:37:47,200
What about next time?

752
00:37:49,710 --> 00:37:51,110
What will it be next time?

753
00:37:55,800 --> 00:37:56,400
By the way,

754
00:38:03,230 --> 00:38:04,090
Your Lordship,

755
00:38:04,280 --> 00:38:07,680
these are perilla candies I made myself,
taught by my granny.

756
00:38:09,880 --> 00:38:11,030
Please accept them.

757
00:38:18,710 --> 00:38:20,240
Are they made from arsenic?

758
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:21,860
You must be joking.

759
00:38:22,760 --> 00:38:23,880
How would I dare?

760
00:38:25,030 --> 00:38:26,290
Why wouldn't you dare?

761
00:38:27,360 --> 00:38:28,420
Poison, after all,

762
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:30,480
must be sugar-coated

763
00:38:31,880 --> 00:38:32,840
to be appealing.

764
00:38:33,710 --> 00:38:36,110
I added borneol and mint.

765
00:38:37,110 --> 00:38:38,970
Interrogations are exhausting.

766
00:38:40,880 --> 00:38:42,030
Keeping one in your mouth

767
00:38:42,030 --> 00:38:43,360
will refresh yourself.

768
00:38:53,400 --> 00:38:54,860
I have to go back to report.

769
00:38:54,920 --> 00:38:56,180
I'll take my leave now.

770
00:39:36,560 --> 00:39:38,860
[Virtue Blesses for Generations]

771
00:39:47,920 --> 00:39:49,410
We must remember all of this.

772
00:39:49,410 --> 00:39:51,740
[Virtue Blesses for Generations]

773
00:39:50,070 --> 00:39:51,070
When we grow up,

774
00:39:51,480 --> 00:39:53,210
we must bring the truth to light

775
00:39:53,360 --> 00:39:55,440
and bring the sinners to justice.

776
00:39:56,070 --> 00:39:57,000
Every blood debt

777
00:39:57,280 --> 00:39:58,110
has a name

778
00:39:57,690 --> 00:39:59,990
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Ancestors
of the Xie Family]

779
00:39:58,710 --> 00:39:59,840
and must be paid off.

780
00:40:00,110 --> 00:40:00,920
My mom

781
00:40:01,070 --> 00:40:02,670
was the best mom in the world.

782
00:40:02,880 --> 00:40:03,740
I'll make those

783
00:40:03,920 --> 00:40:05,110
who killed her

784
00:40:05,110 --> 00:40:06,440
suffer dearly for this.

785
00:40:09,280 --> 00:40:09,800
Mother.

786
00:40:09,490 --> 00:40:12,390
[Virtue Blesses for Generations]

787
00:40:10,760 --> 00:40:13,560
The Xie family already regards me
as their mascot.

788
00:40:13,920 --> 00:40:15,110
I, as a chess piece,

789
00:40:15,760 --> 00:40:17,360
have been swallowed by them.

790
00:40:17,760 --> 00:40:19,870
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Ancestors
of the Xie Family]

791
00:40:18,190 --> 00:40:19,190
Danyue Pavilion.

792
00:40:19,710 --> 00:40:21,000
I've used their hands

793
00:40:21,800 --> 00:40:23,060
to take it back for you.

794
00:40:23,840 --> 00:40:28,500
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Ancestors
of the Xie Family]

795
00:40:24,070 --> 00:40:25,600
This is just the beginning.

796
00:40:26,150 --> 00:40:27,070
Rest assured.

797
00:40:27,400 --> 00:40:29,030
Every single injustice,

798
00:40:29,510 --> 00:40:31,630
I will clear them

799
00:40:32,920 --> 00:40:34,630
one by one.

800
00:40:35,580 --> 00:40:39,840
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

801
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:37,670
Since this show has begun,

802
00:40:38,280 --> 00:40:40,410
I must make this good play go all the way

803
00:40:40,760 --> 00:40:43,030
to its liveliest part
to be worth watching.
